{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51544","headline":"题建造寺 · 张爲","name":"题建造寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叠嶂横空向郡西，迥然高峭衆山低。\n树梢缺处见城郭，日影落时闻鼓鼙。\n（《舆地纪胜》卷一三○《福建路·泉州》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}